tent":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"blockquote","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://emojipedia.org/light-bulb"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"ðŸ’¡","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" Pro tip:","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" Many teams are bogged down by time spent searching for the information they need. If your team is dedicating hours to prospect research, that's a clear opportunity for AI intervention. Tools like Artisan can automate this research process, allowing your sales team to focus on high-value activities. Things like relationship building and closing deals.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"heading-4","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"2. Evaluate your data","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"The effectiveness of AI is directly tied to the quality and quantity of your data. You need to consider what data you have and how accurate it is. According to Gartner, poor data quality costs organizations an average of ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.gartner.com/smarterwithgartner/how-to-improve-your-data-quality"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"$$12.9 million every year","marks":[{"type":"underline"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":".Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"You can start solving this problem by asking the right questions. Are you collecting the information you need? Are there any gaps that will keep you from maximzing the value of AI?","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"blockquote","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"Before diving into AI when it comes to B2B lead generation, the first thing you should make sure to have is accurate data that mimics your target audience. Without quality data it is very difficult to use AI. This is because AI tools rely on accurate data sets to provide analysis and recommendations on how to generate leads,","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€ said Ryan Doser, VP of Inbound Marketing at ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://empathyfirstmedia.com/"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Empathy First Media","marks":[{"type":"underline"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":".","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"For example, let's say you're a B2B software company targeting mid-size enterprises. Your current customer relationship management solution might contain basic information like company names and phone numbers. But you might be missing important information about your contactâ€™s preferences.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Don't be discouraged if your data isn't perfect. Many AI tools offer data cleaning and enrichment capabilities. Start where you are and develop a plan for ongoing data improvement.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Consider data hygiene practices like:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Regular data audits","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Standardized data entry processes","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Integration of data across sources","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"heading-4","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"3. Set clear metrics","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Define what success looks like for your team. Are you aiming to increase conversion rates by 20%? Cut lead response time in half? Reduce cost per lead by 30%? These Key Performance Indicators (KPIs) guide your AI implementation.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"And remember, some benefits of AI (like freed-up time for your sales team or a better customer experience) might not be directly quantifiable right away. But they're still valuable. Keep track of both hard metrics and qualitative improvements.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Choose the right AI tools","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"At this stage, you can select the AI tools that will transform your lead generation process. Consider these factors before you do that.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-4","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Specific needs and use cases","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Align your tool selection with the pain points and goals you identified for the sales process. If personalization at scale is your primary challenge, prioritize tools with advanced content customization capabilities. If you're struggling with lead quality, look for solutions with predictive scoring.Â  \n\nYou may also choose to break this down by sales funnel stage.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","valu