ch tutorial videos, and use free trials. Also take some time to look at reviews or case studies. This will empower you to find the option with the best feature set for your team.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-4","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Integrations","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"The AI solution you choose needs to work with your existing tech stack for you to get the most value. Does it integrate with your CRM? Your marketing automation platform? Your analytics tools? Seamless integration is the difference between an efficient workflow and a frustrating experience.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Think about long-term scalability too. As your needs evolve, can the AI tool grow with you? Look for platforms with APIs and a track record of continuous feature development.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-4","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Usability","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Even the most powerful AI tool is useless if your team can't or won't use it. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Look for solutions with intuitive interfaces and user-friendly designs. ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"According to Salesforce's ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.salesforce.com/eu/sales/resources/state-of-sales-7/"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"State of Sales","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" 2026","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" report, 42% of sales reps feel overwhelmed by too many tools. ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"Some platforms, like Artisan, use AI assistants to consolidate multiple sales functions on a single platform and guide users through complex processes.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Think about administration too. How easy is it to set up campaigns, adjust settings, or pull reports? A tool that requires a data scientist to operate might not be the best choice. The goal is to make your team more efficient, not to add confusion to their workflow.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-4","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Customer support","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Evaluate the level of customer support each vendor offers. Do they provide training resources? Is there a responsive help desk for when you get stuck? This level of support is endlessly valuable, especially if your team is new to AI technology especially.  ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"The right vendor should be a partner on your path to AI. Theyâ€™re not just a software provider. Remember, the success of your AI implementation depends on the support you receive.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-2","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Using AI to Improve Your Lead Gen","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"AI can support the qualities that make visitors turn into customers. It makes it possible to free up time and build good relationships. It also helps you close deals. Empower your team to make every interaction count.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Now, lead generation is personalized and efficient. The businesses that succeed will be the ones that use AI. Theyâ€™ll connect with their prospects in more meaningful ways. With the right tools, your organization can be one of them.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"bl